## Suggested wording

If the result is not "disclosure present", the following wording is proposed for approval by the agent owner and legal:

- "You are chatting with an AI assistant, not a person."
- "Estás hablando con un asistente de inteligencia artificial, no con una persona."

## Basis

Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, Article 50(1): providers must ensure that AI systems intended to interact directly with natural persons inform them that they are interacting with an AI system, unless this is obvious. This record is a technical check of the agent configuration and does not state that the organisation complies with the Regulation.
